  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>This combination of relugolix with estradiol and norethisterone acetate is used to treat hormone-dependent gynaecological conditions such as uterine fibroids and endometriosis. It is an approved medicine, available in some countries as a prescription treatment, though detailed regulatory information is not given here.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q421352&quot;>Wikidata Q421352</a>; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>relugolix;estradiol;norethisterone acetate</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00717&quot;>DB00717</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/6230&quot;>6230</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:7627&quot;>7627</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q421352&quot;>Q421352</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C20H26O2</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>298.426 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
